onality.py` (18:51 PDT): 6 on the parent 35ca10e501b, 5 on the change. Removed: test_no_tests_rooted_imports_anywhere_under_tests and test_no_core_module_imports_heavy_stack_at_module_scope. Added: test_no_core_module_imports_heavy_stack_nested_at_module_scope. `_OPTIONALITY_SUITE_ITEM_COUNT` stays 10; `tests/unit/test_ci_workflow_parity.py` passes (63 passed, 3 skipped across the 5 affected modules).\n\nMechanism census, `python scripts/check_mechanism_delta.py --check`: byte-identical output on the parent 35ca10e501b and on the change, `active=651 new=25 increased=0 stale=0`, exit 0 on both. The delta is 0.\n\nmake verify (18:55 to 19:47 PDT, HEAD 1c03961ec1f unchanged for the whole run): lint and typecheck green (ruff all checks passed; mypy no issues in 749 files). Tests: 17 failed, 19732 passed, 105 skipped in 51 min 08 s. All 17 are the known arm64 pandoc set (13 test_wiki_render.py, 3 test_rich_text_cutover.py, 1 diffing/test_diff_comments_cutover_neutral.py; `Errno 86 Bad CPU type` on the x86_64 pypandoc binary). 0 FAILED outside tests/unit/reconciler/ and 0 `^ERROR tests` lines."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792983178588674976,"uuid":"b9fb622c-48ed-4949-a6d4-ba8d774bbc97"}